      "id": "teach_5",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Sometimes efficiency is stated as work per person.\n\n'A man does twice a woman's work in the same time' means 1 man = 2 women.\nSo 3 men + 4 women = 10 women-equivalents.",
